  /// Chai](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yosef_Hayyim) in [Rav Pe'alim, chelek 2, Sod Yesharim siman
  /// 4](https://hebrewbooks.org/pdfpager.aspx?req=1401&pgnum=461). This time is close to six hours after
